docs {
  ## GET /api/bot/user

  Returns lightweight user context for the embedded recommendation bot widget.
  If authenticated, returns first name and latest saved measurements so the
  bot can greet the shopper by name and pre-fill sizing data.

  ### Authenticated (200)
  ```json
  {
    "user": {
      "firstName": "Ahmed",
      "isLoggedIn": true,
      "latestMeasurements": {
        "heightCm": 178,
        "weightKg": 75,
        "chestCm": 96,
        "waistCm": 82,
        "hipsCm": 98
      }
    }
  }
  ```

  ### Anonymous (200)
  ```json
  { "user": { "isLoggedIn": false } }
  ```
}
